<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Team Git Demo</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
        }

        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ccc;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .member {
            background-color: #e8f5e9;
            padding: 10px;
            margin: 8px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h1>Git Multi-User Project</h1>

        <p>This project demonstrates teamwork using Git and GitHub.</p>

        <h2>Our Team</h2>

        <div class="member">Member 1 - Project Manager</div>
        <div class="member">Member 2 - Frontend Developer</div>
        <div class="member">Member 3 - Backend Developer</div>
        <div class="member">Member 4 - Tester</div>
        <div class="member">Member 5 - UI Designer</div>

        <br>

        <button>View Project</button>

    </div>

</body>
</html>